OL,3,ADolly Parton laid to rest alongside
OL,4,Ahusband in Nashville
OL,5,
OL,6,FLainey Parton posted an emotional
OL,7,Ftribute a day after the burial, saying:
OL,8,F"It still doesn't feel real that she's
OL,9,Fgone. I'm going to miss her voice, her
OL,10,Flaugh, her hugs, and just knowing she
OL,11,Fwas there."
